    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n78633" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραπομπ-ός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			= foreg., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. νῆες</span>
		ships <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attending as convoy</i>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.52.5
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				15.2.6
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>purveyor,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				POxy.
				1844.1
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(vi A.D.)</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> (proparox.) 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παράνυμφος</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i> s.v.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πάροχοι</span>.</div>
